  "description": "DAVPID crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H66 Dy12 N6 O78,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1O (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2O (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1P (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2P (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1Q (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2Q (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.642-3.823 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.83-109.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy12(HL)6(L)6(NO3)6(H2O)6]·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
